# BuildKit build-context exclusions for talon.
#
# Diagnosed alongside falcon-id 2026-06-04: talon's CI pins
#   GOMODCACHE = ${CI_PROJECT_DIR}/.go/mod
#   GOCACHE    = ${CI_PROJECT_DIR}/.go/build
# so the lint + test stages populate .go/ inside the repo before the
# build stage hands it to BuildKit as `--local context=…`. None of it
# is needed inside the image (the Dockerfile's `go mod download` pulls
# fresh from Athens), so we drop it from the context.
#
# Talon's `e2e/` directory holds 38 MB of Playwright test fixtures —
# also useless inside the runtime image (the Dockerfile only COPYs
# go.mod, go.sum, cmd/, internal/, api/).

# ─── Go caches (the big one) ──────────────────────────────────────
.go/
**/.go/

# ─── Git ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.gitlab-ci.yml
.gitlab/

# ─── Test suites — not COPYd into the image ──────────────────────
e2e/
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
**/fixtures/

# ─── Build artifacts (from local `go build`) ──────────────────────
bin/
dist/
**/*.test
**/*.exe
**/*.out
coverage.out
coverage.html
cover.out

# ─── CI artifact files passed via needs: artifacts: true ──────────
gosec-report.json
sbom.json
sbom*.json
sbom*.xml
harbor-trivy-*.json
trivy-*.json

# ─── Vendored deps (Athens replaces) ──────────────────────────────
vendor/

# ─── Examples + docs + deploy manifests — not runtime inputs ──────
examples/
docs/
deploy/

# ─── IDE / editor / OS detritus ───────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# ─── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.secret
SECRETS.local.txt*

# ─── Docker meta — not needed inside the image ────────────────────
.dockerignore
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml

# ─── Linter configs — only useful in CI ───────────────────────────
.golangci.yml
.golangci-*.yml
